  "architecture_decisions_for_root": [
    "Reuse MethodCandidates/NodeIndex/SignatureResolver; internal source-origin visibility filter and declaration-ID closure, no new overload/type/qualifier scorer.",
    "Alias deduplication uses exact locked publication identity, never a projected/display method name.",
    "An exported ordinary function using a private method requires method closure even with no direct root method call; public interfaces include unused exported methods.",
    "Existing return-qualifier consumption must also activate for admitted exported/projected method declaration IDs, including absent receiver annotation; ordinary A2 absent-field behavior remains unchanged.",
    "Proposed same_version_methods_v5 closed profile, library_callable_context.v2, consumer1.2.0, additive library_callable_context_v2 consumer proof plus existing library_qualifier_context_v1 prerequisite; AST2.0/2.1 and artifactv3 unchanged.",
    "Builder strips only new admitted method-library proof; existing floor/runtime/nominal/varip capabilities unchanged and no PineLib manifest capability addition.",
    "At most provisional and final normal semantic pass; existing failed-candidate budgets each preserved, no unbounded relink fixed point."
  ],
  "limits_and_nonclaims": [
    "Before early shape/name rejection does not certify privacy, qualifier, default, floor or lifecycle negative dimensions.",
    "Cross-library ambiguity rejection and direct-import-only visibility are bounded implementation profiles, not proven Pine semantic rejection rules.",
    "User method namespace-function form, transitive root visibility, indistinguishable tie priority and optional receiver defaults remain separately UNVERIFIED.",
    "V5 simple-reference annotation exception remains the unchanged A2 UNVERIFIED profile; no v6 backport claim.",
    "Mixed-language library execution and Stage3 request features are not added.",
    "No imported-method generated lifecycle acceptance yet; two successful generated cases are existing function-only legacy controls.",
    "Fully replaced self-sealed source/context cannot authenticate an original author input without an externally trusted identity."
  ]
